{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21058","headline":"静女春曙曲 · 李贺","name":"静女春曙曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫩叶怜芳抱新蕊，泣露枝枝滴夭泪。\n粉窗香咽颓晓云，锦堆花密藏春睡。\n恋屏孔雀摇金尾，莺舌分明呼婢子。\n冰洞寒龙半匣水，一只商鸾逐烟起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}